WEBVTT

00:00:59.289 --> 00:01:01.758
Politico and now Axios.

00:01:01.792 --> 00:01:03.727
And at my current company,

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.696
the entire premise of the company

00:01:05.696 --> 00:01:09.900
is to teach journalists
and then CEOs, academics and others

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.970
how to use far fewer words.

00:01:13.003 --> 00:01:14.471
So why?

00:01:14.504 --> 00:01:17.307
Why, if I spent my entire life
writing lots of words,

00:01:17.341 --> 00:01:19.209
do I want people to use fewer of them?

00:01:20.077 --> 00:01:23.213
Because the data -- and you -- made me.

00:01:24.114 --> 00:01:26.850
If you actually look
at what you're doing --

00:01:26.883 --> 00:01:29.553
One of the most interesting things
about technology,

00:01:29.586 --> 00:01:33.090
one of the creepiest things
about technology is